    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/285102675af5c3a98f084922350eed56.poster.avif?t=1743522878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/285102675af5c3a98f084922350eed56.gif?t=1743522878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you run a small gas station in <i>Carrot Town</i>, serving its quirky citizens, stocking supplies, and keeping business afloat. By night, you must outwit and survive a terrifying monster that lurks in the shadows... all while playing a little game called <strong>Chunky JUMP!\u00a0</strong>on your trusty BIRD BOY. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE </strong>the night, keep your focus, time your jumps, and don\u2019t let the fear break your concentration. Survive until morning\u2026 if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY</strong> as Jeff, the gas station worker and talk with the residents of Carrot Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LISTEN</strong> to the mysteries going on in Carrot Town, learn new information and make your own conclusions...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>STORY MODE</strong> and find out more about Carrot Town's mysteries and citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong> to play multiple new levels and collect skins of familiar faces!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Bun-Bun coins by completing <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/285102675af5c3a98f084922350eed56.poster.avif?t=1743522878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/285102675af5c3a98f084922350eed56.gif?t=1743522878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you run a small gas station in <i>Carrot Town</i>, serving its quirky citizens, stocking supplies, and keeping business afloat. By night, you must outwit and survive a terrifying monster that lurks in the shadows... all while playing a little game called <strong>Chunky JUMP!\u00a0</strong>on your trusty BIRD BOY. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE </strong>the night, keep your focus, time your jumps, and don\u2019t let the fear break your concentration. Survive until morning\u2026 if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY</strong> as Jeff, the gas station worker and talk with the residents of Carrot Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LISTEN</strong> to the mysteries going on in Carrot Town, learn new information and make your own conclusions...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>STORY MODE</strong> and find out more about Carrot Town's mysteries and citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong> to play multiple new levels and collect skins of familiar faces!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Bun-Bun coins by completing <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p 